rule check_result_1 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the date of birth of the check result is a value if
    the people of the situation include an id with the value
    and the id is equal to the person id of the parameters.

rule check_result_2 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the age of the check result is -1 if
    it is not the case that the date of birth of the check result is a value.

rule check_result_3 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the age of the check result is -1 if
    it is not the case that the as of date of the parameters is a date.

rule check_result_4 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the age of the check result is a value if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the date of birth of the check result is a second value
        or it is not the case that the as of date of the parameters is a date
    and the date of birth of the check result is the second value
    and the as of date of the parameters is the date
    and the number of whole years from the second value to the date is the value.

rule check_result_5 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is true if
    the date of birth of the check result is a value
    and the age of the check result >= the min age of the parameters.

rule check_result_6 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is false if
    the date of birth of the check result is a value
    and the age of the check result < the min age of the parameters.

